Looking for Elisa....
Here she is...

Hello, I'm Elisa, how can I help you?
> How do you do. Please state your problem.

> Tell me more about such feelings.

> In what way?

> Do computers worry you?

> Really, about a big ship?

> Your sister?

> Do you think it is likely that only you could sleep?

> You do not seem quite certain.

> Is it because you are always tired that you came to me?

> I am not interested in names.

> Were you really?

> I am sorry to hear you are unhappy.

> Why do you mention computers?

> Is that the real reason?

> Why do you ask?

> Really, everyone?

> You seem quite positive.

> Are you saying no just to be negative?

> Why do you say your father?

> I am sorry, I only speak English.

> What would it mean to you if you got a new job?

> How do you know you can not sleep at night?

> Do you often feel you need help?

> How have I helped you to be happy?

> Plese tell me more ...

> Goodbye. My secretary will send you a bill.
